# Level 3 (planet 3): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots (or not) and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. Turrets 02, the large creatures 21 with their thrusters, and the egg 5F
# (which the pod shoots, leaving an exit in the items list).
level 3
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
